WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.629
Demographics to Death Pipeline.

00:00:02.579 --> 00:00:04.852
OSINT topological proof.

00:00:04.852 --> 00:00:16.340
Using Auditor General findings, IRCC data, StatsCan longitudinal databases, and Brookfield corporate filings, this investigation empirically maps the causal chain from immigration intake to MAID death.

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:26.670
The Auditor General documented a 1.8 million application backlog at IRCC and 32.4 million dollars in fraudulent LMIA approvals at ESDC.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:33.977
These are not administrative failures: they are structural conditions that create the migrant precarity required for the pipeline to function.

00:00:33.977 --> 00:00:38.522
400,000 permanent residents arrive per year with no housing plan.

00:00:38.522 --> 00:00:42.772
43 percent report financial hardship within 24 months.

00:00:42.772 --> 00:00:50.068
TFW workers are locked into debt bondage through closed work permits and recruiter fees of 5,000 to 80,000 dollars.

00:00:50.068 --> 00:00:52.034
When they break — MAID.

00:00:52.034 --> 00:00:57.011
Prime Minister Mark Carney holds 6.8 million dollars in Brookfield options.

00:00:57.011 --> 00:01:00.318
Brookfield owns long-term care infrastructure.

00:01:00.318 --> 00:01:06.624
MAID reduces that infrastructure cost exposure by 20,685 dollars per death.

00:01:06.624 --> 00:01:08.681
The pipeline is mapped.

00:01:08.681 --> 00:01:11.272
The beneficiary is the PM.

00:01:11.272 --> 00:01:13.363
The OSINT node graph.

00:01:13.363 --> 00:01:16.295
Eight nodes, seven documented edges.

00:01:16.295 --> 00:01:17.818
Key numbers.

00:01:17.818 --> 00:01:21.329
All from official government sources or corporate filings.

00:01:21.329 --> 00:01:25.772
Auditor General findings that document the pipeline structural failure points.

00:01:25.772 --> 00:01:29.443
Brookfield's healthcare and senior housing infrastructure.

00:01:29.443 --> 00:01:33.386
The financial beneficiary of reduced long-term care demand.

00:01:33.386 --> 00:01:38.613
The financial flow calculation from immigration policy to Brookfield portfolio benefit.

00:01:38.613 --> 00:01:43.897
Mark Carney's stated ideological framework for reframing aging as fiscal liability.

00:01:43.897 --> 00:01:50.693
The academic study that explicitly modelled MAID as a cost-avoidance strategy for 15 million chronic condition patients.
